iness_count":0},{"category":"Desserts","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Cupcakes","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FxosV3rl41ZlR724nnrImA","review_id":"JSuNfIgyboLT-fZEHZlVqw","date":"2018-05-24T21:11:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9349019527435303,"text_excerpt":"So I'm not a big fan of most bakeries. I find the baked goods too dry and the icing too plentiful and sugary. Nothing Bundt Cakes has none of these problems! I have eaten these cakes sold by cart during Mardi Gras and bought directly from their shop. Everytime I've eaten them they've been moist and delicious. The cream cheese icing is not that sweet either and applied sparingly which I like. I like the many different flavors that are offered. The service at the bakery is super friendly too. I highly recommend checking them out!"},{"business_id":"FxosV3rl41ZlR724nnrImA","review_id":"oSHr_Nd0syQ_G9czGYlFGA","date":"2019-08-12T21:05:57","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9287166595458984,"text_excerpt":"I absolutely love nothing bundt cakes! I don't think there's any flavor that I don't like! My favorite is the lemon and carrot cakes. I tried a sample of the blueberry bliss and it was amazing! I tried the red velvet this time and it did not disappoint! I will be back for more of the blueberry bliss so I hope it stays around for a while. Always very friendly service. The mini bundtinis only are sold as a dozen ; wish you could purchase separately. I ordered 10 of the bundt cakes for an event for my guests! They loved it!"},{"business_id":"FxosV3rl41ZlR724nnrImA","review_id":"0UcO9RLAzaBJrWAcWeNnxQ","date":"2017-10-20T00:45:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9236562848091125,"text_excerpt":"Cakes are made from scratch, fresh daily. The small bundtinis are affordable and perfect for the calorie-counter. All the flavors I have sampled have been wonderful. It's a family-run franchise, I think and the location uptown is great! All the staff have been lovely to me and they often participate in local events such as Art for Arts Sake or the Scales and Ales event at the aquarium. They also sell a variety of cards and will dress up a bundtini cake to go with a tiny card and ribbon all in the same price! And, there are lots of candles to choose from too! Go!!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FxosV3rl41ZlR724nnrImA","photo_id":"Uvq0Uod3DMhXcGvvxHWWXQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Uvq0Uod3DMhXcGvvxHWWXQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
